## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
## nexus | KingCRAB_Ba133DirectRate.physics.mac
##
## Delayed EL-thinning controls for the Ba-133 direct-light rate study
##
## The NEXT Collaboration
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generate exactly 50 S2 photons per ionization electron. At 1 bar argon,
# 900 kV/m and a 7 mm EL gap, the KingCRAB argon parameterization predicts
# 477.4 photons/electron, so each scored S2 photon represents 9.548 photons.
/Physics/Electroluminescence/table_generation true
/Physics/Electroluminescence/photons_per_point 50
